    +----------------optprobe_template_restore_end-----------------+
    |- nop                                                         |
    |(replaced to next address of the probe point)                 |
    +------------------optprobe_template_val-----------------------+
    |- 0 (two 32-bit words)                                        |
    |(replaced to params for optprobe_optimized_callback)          |
    +-----------------optprobe_template_orig_addr------------------+
    |- 0 (two 32-bit words)                                        |
